{"seq":7,"slug":"ethnography-and-fieldwork","title":"民族志与田野工作","stage":"DONE","category":"anthropology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork","rating":{"composite":3.49,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 民族志与田野工作\n\n如果说有一样东西最能定义人类学、把它与其他社会科学区分开来，那就是民族志与田野工作。人类学家不满足于在书斋里阅读资料或发放问卷，而是亲身走进所研究的人群之中，与他们长期共同生活，在日常的参与和观察中理解一种文化。这种独特的研究方式，既是一套方法，也是一种认识世界的态度，是理解人类学之所以为人类学的关键。\n\n本知识库适合希望理解人类学研究方法、或对田野研究感兴趣的读者，无需专业训练，系统讲解民族志从田野到文本、从方法到伦理的全过程。我们从民族志的双重含义与参与观察这一核心方法出发，依次走过田野工作的实际开展、具体研究方法、文本写作的艺术，最终落到田野伦理与这门方法的当代意义，力求既呈现民族志的技艺，又传达它作为一种认识态度的深层精神。\n\n第一章**民族志基础**界定民族志的双重含义、参与观察这一核心方法、整体论视角，以及它\"深入他者、反观自身\"的根本意义。第二章**田野工作的开展**揭示从进入田野、建立信任、克服文化冲击到记录田野笔记的实际过程与甘苦。第三章**民族志的研究方法**考察访谈、谱系法、生命史、个案研究等如何与参与观察协同运作。第四章**民族志的写作**剖析从田野经验到文本的转化、声音与表述的难题、以及\"深描\"的写法。第五章**伦理、反思与意义**讨论知情同意、权力关系与反身性，并考察民族志的当代应用与恒久意义。读完本知识库，你将理解人类学最独特的研究方式，也将对\"如何理解一种不同于自己的生活\"获得一套深刻的方法与态度。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"民族志基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-ethnography","title":"什么是民族志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/foundations/what-is-ethnography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"participant-observation","title":"参与观察：民族志的核心方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/foundations/participant-observation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"holism-and-significance","title":"整体论视角与根本意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/foundations/holism-and-significance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"doing-fieldwork","title":"田野工作的开展","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/doing-fieldwork","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entering-the-field","title":"进入田野","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/doing-fieldwork/entering-the-field"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rapport-and-culture-shock","title":"建立信任与文化冲击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/doing-fieldwork/rapport-and-culture-shock"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fieldnotes","title":"田野笔记与记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/doing-fieldwork/fieldnotes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"methods","title":"民族志的研究方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interviews","title":"访谈：从闲聊到深度访谈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/methods/interviews"},{"seq":2,"slug":"genealogy-and-life-history","title":"谱系法与生命史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/methods/genealogy-and-life-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"case-study-and-triangulation","title":"个案研究与多方印证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/methods/case-study-and-triangulation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"writing-ethnography","title":"民族志的写作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/writing-ethnography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-field-to-text","title":"从田野到文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/writing-ethnography/from-field-to-text"},{"seq":2,"slug":"voice-and-representation","title":"声音与表述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/writing-ethnography/voice-and-representation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"thick-description","title":"深描：阐释意义的写法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/writing-ethnography/thick-description"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"ethics-significance","title":"伦理、反思与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/ethics-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consent-and-no-harm","title":"知情同意与不伤害","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/ethics-significance/consent-and-no-harm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"power-and-reflexivity","title":"权力关系与反身性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/ethics-significance/power-and-reflexivity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-applications","title":"民族志的当代应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/ethics-significance/contemporary-applications"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"民族志的恒久意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/ethnography-and-fieldwork/ethics-significance/significance"}]}]}